{
  "bodyHash": "/PkpyU1UJd4=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。滿懷愛意製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「愚人節」為遊戲增添了各種滑稽有趣的功能與遊戲機制。預設情況下，這些功能<strong>僅在4月1日</strong>自動啟用。但您也可以透過設定，讓它們在任何日子都能啟用。遊戲提供全域開關，您也可以個別啟用/停用所有功能。這個模組希望能為遊玩您整合包或伺服器的所有人帶來歡笑！<br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span>：<br>&nbsp;•&nbsp; 玩家會腳朝枕頭睡覺。<br>&nbsp;•&nbsp; 流浪商人會帶著驢子而非羊駝生成。<br>&nbsp;•&nbsp; 讓貓吠叫、狼喵喵叫。<br>&nbsp;•&nbsp; 擠牛奶時有機率獲得水桶或岩漿桶。<br>&nbsp;•&nbsp; 苦力怕可能不會爆炸，而是發射帶有苦力怕圖案的煙火火箭。<br>&nbsp;•&nbsp; 馬鈴薯作物掉落的所有馬鈴薯皆帶有毒。<br>&nbsp;•&nbsp; 骷髏可能拿著劍與盾牌而非弓生成。<br>&nbsp;•&nbsp; 從弓射出的任何普通箭矢有機率附加隨機藥水效果。撿起時又會變回普通箭矢。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's Extra Bundle\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"環境：用戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableOnlyOnApril1st</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">愚人節功能是否僅在4月1日啟用。若設為 false，則會始終啟用。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>april1stChanceMultiplier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.0，最小 0.0，最大 1000.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">可用於增加功能在4月1日發生的機率。例如，您可以設定「enableOnlyOnApril1st」為 false、「chanceCreepersExplodeIntoFireworks」為 0.01，以及「april1stChanceMultiplier」為 25.0。這樣一來，在4月1日以外的時間，苦力怕只有1/100的機率發射煙火火箭；而在愚人節當天則有1/4的機率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>makeCatsBarkAndDogsMeow</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否讓貓吠叫、狗喵喵叫。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>makePlayersSleepWithFeetOnPillow</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否讓玩家以相反方式睡覺，腳朝枕頭。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>makeWanderingTraderSpawnWithDonkeys</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否讓流浪商人帶著兩隻驢子而非羊駝生成。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceCowGivesDifferentBucket</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.2，最小 0.0，最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">擠牛奶時，取得岩漿桶或水桶而非牛奶桶的機率。設為 0 以停用此功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceCreepersExplodeIntoFireworks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.5，最小 0.0，最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">苦力怕是否會改為發射帶有苦力怕圖案的煙火火箭，而非爆炸。預設機率為 50%。設為 0 以停用。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chancePotatoCropDropsPoisonous</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 1.0，最小 0.0，最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">馬鈴薯作物收成時，掉落物變為有毒馬鈴薯的機率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceSkeletonHasSwordAndShield</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.25，最小 0.0，最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">骷髏生成時持有劍與盾牌而非弓的機率。設為 0 以停用。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceNormalArrowFiredHasRandomEffect</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.33，最小 0.0，最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家射出的箭矢附加隨機藥水效果的機率。設為 0 以停用。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>影片展示：</strong></span><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2VfpIna69U0\" height=\"475\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></span><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">流浪商人把牠的羊駝留在家裡，帶了兩隻驢子來！</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/april-fools/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">苦力怕有 50% 的機率不會爆炸，而是發射煙火火箭！</span><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/april-fools/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">玩家和村民會腳朝枕頭睡覺！</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/april-fools/c.png\" alt=\"\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/april-fools/d.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">第一人稱視角下也有效果：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/april-fools/e.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">骷髏有 25% 的機率帶著劍與盾牌生成！</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/april-fools/f.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模組，只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面上追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請到&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
